{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33650","headline":"金谷园怀古 · 邵谒","name":"金谷园怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在富莫骄奢，骄奢多自亡。\n爲女莫骋容，骋容多自伤。\n如何金谷园，郁郁椒兰房。\n昨夜绮罗列，今日池馆荒。\n竹死不变节，花落有余香。\n美人抱义死，千载名犹彰。\n娇歌无遗音，明月留清光。\n浮云易改色，衰草难重芳。\n不学韩侯妇，衔冤报宋王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}